// Black Anvil Item Visual Library
//
// Each entry maps a visual key to its model, scale, grip transform, and variants.
// Multiple items can share one visual (with different tints).
//
// Scale 0.0254 converts Doom3 units (~1 inch) to metres.
// Axis indicates which direction the weapon's long axis is in the source model.
//
// Models are from The Dark Mod (CC-BY-NC-SA 3.0). See ATTRIBUTION.md.

